 bgslibrary  algorithms  
 
gmg  gmg      
  ibgs quote gmg    
  initializationframes 20   decisionthreshold 0 7  
  
  debug construction gmg   
  initloadsaveconfig algorithmname   
 
  cv  initmodule video    
  cv  setuseoptimized cv  setnumthreads 4   
 
  fgbg   cv  algorithm  create cv  backgroundsubtractorgmg   backgroundsubtractor gmg    
  
 
gmg   gmg     
  debug destruction gmg gmg  process cv  mat  img input  cv  mat  img output  cv  mat  img bgmodel  
  
  init img input  img output  img bgmodel firsttime    
    fgbg- set  initializationframes   initializationframes   
    fgbg- set  decisionthreshold   decisionthreshold fgbg empty      
    std  cerr     failed create     algorithmname    std  endl fgbg  img input  img foreground   
    fgbg  getbackgroundimage img background   
 
  img input copyto img segmentation   
  cv  add img input  cv  scalar 100  100  0   img segmentation  img foreground showoutput    
    cv  imshow algorithmname     fg   img foreground   
    cv  imshow algorithmname     bg   img background   
    
  
 
  img foreground copyto img output   
  img background copyto img bgmodel   
 
  firsttime gmg  save config cv  filestorage  fs    
  fs     initializationframes     initializationframes  
  fs     decisionthreshold     decisionthreshold  
  fs     showoutput     showoutput gmg  load config cv  filestorage  fs    
  fs  initializationframes      initializationframes  
  fs  decisionthreshold      decisionthreshold  
  fs  showoutput      showoutput  
  
 
   bgslibrary algorithms gmg